ot good she said some of  Bernie's allies are two conflict based  that also rubbed a lot of Bernie  supporters the wrong way  AOC also launched a pact earlier this  year which is not looking to primary  centrist Democrats it's focused on  flipping red states to blue the the goal  of a o'seas pact is not to find centrist  Democrats and replace them it's to find  red seats and turn them blue replacing  Republicans with Democrats now I have to  tell you this makes me see a OC as much  more clever and shrewd politically as a  political operative than I imagined you  guys many of you criticize me  occasionally for saying hey you know AOC  has a lot of the right ideas but not the  right political practicality not the  right political approach I see that as  changing here now there's lots of people  that are furious about this TYT host  John Cougar has gone after AOC for this  a bunch of others have but let's think  this through first of all almost  everyone changes when they got elected  and and this is why I always say don't  defy or glorify individual politicians  they are all elected by the system we  currently have and essentially every  single one of them to some degree it  varies but to some degree when they  become elected officials under that  system they will start to reap reinforce  or defend to some degree some elements  of the system that got them elected once  they get into power that applies to just  about everybody it doesn't mean that  they flip and abandon their values  that's not what I'm saying but that's  not the important analysis for me the  important analysis for me is that we  just got done talking about Bernie lost  not because his ideas are bad but  because a lot of the people around him  are toxic because of his relationship  with those in positions of power because  the country just isn't as overtly left  as Bernie Sanders for the last six weeks  we've been saying many of us the future  of the progressive movement is in  somebody with Bernie sensibilities  Bernie's values many of Bernie's policy  goals but who has a better team around  them  fewer toxic people better branding none  of this democratic socialist stuff the  revolution language is not particularly  useful to Bernie aoc isn't changing her  political positions here her view on  medicare-for-all hasn't changed her view  on the green new deal hasn't changed  she's changing her approach maybe at  least that's what it seems like this is  what we've been talking about guys we  don't need someone who differs from  Bernie on core values Bernie has the  right core values AOC shares Bernie's  core values nothing has changed as far  as that goes  AOC is doing exactly what Bernie didn't  do a OSI is doing something to get  around what ultimately led to Bernie  getting crushed on Super Tuesday and  then more on Super Tuesday too and more  on Super Tuesday three people keep  saying hey we need Bernie's ideas with  better framing packaging and public  relations that's what a OSI is leaning  towards here a OSI is looking to become  a force for change by building these  relationships where in the next six  years eight years she could have a long  laundry list of legislative  accomplishments  she's working within the system to  invoke change now that's an area of  disagreement bernie has more of an  approach of destroying the system  revolution and then rebuilding it from  the ground up working within the system  has gotten us many important things gay  marriage Violence Against Women Act food  stamps Social Security Consumer  Financial Protection Bureau pre-existing  conditions coverage and being on your  parent's insurance until age 26 labor  laws birth control now has it been  enough no no way in hell has it also led  to bad things of course I mean you know  look at the Iraq war the Iraq war is the  epitome of working within the system  with centrist Democrats in great part  that got us the Iraq war but when icao  see step away from some of the  absolutism o